		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ringo Starr]]></title>
			<link>/ringo-starr/</link>
			<pubDate>Wed, 02 Oct 2024 12:08:34 +0000</pubDate>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">/?p=1</guid>
			<description></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:group {"layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group"><!-- wp:block-development-examples/interactivity-router-2f43f8 {"prev":"george-harrison"} -->
<div class="wp-block-block-development-examples-interactivity-router-2f43f8"><!-- wp:columns -->
<div class="wp-block-columns"><!-- wp:column -->
<div class="wp-block-column"><!-- wp:image {"id":62,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"none"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/WordPress/block-development-examples/trunk/plugins/interactivity-router-2f43f8/_playground/images/ringo-starr.webp" alt="" class="wp-image-62"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->

<!-- wp:column -->
<div class="wp-block-column"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><strong>Ringo Starr</strong> (born Richard Starkey) is a British musician and actor best known as the drummer for <strong>The Beatles</strong>. He joined the band in 1962, completing the classic lineup of John Lennon, Paul McCartney, George Harrison, and himself. Ringo’s steady, creative drumming style was integral to the band's sound, and though he was not a primary songwriter, he sang lead vocals on popular Beatles tracks like "With a Little Help from My Friends" and "Yellow Submarine."</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:column --></div>
<!-- /wp:columns --></div>
<!-- /wp:block-development-examples/interactivity-router-2f43f8 --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>After The Beatles disbanded in 1970, Starr pursued a successful solo career, releasing hit singles such as "It Don't Come Easy," "Photograph," and "You're Sixteen." In addition to his solo work, he has collaborated with many other musicians and formed the <strong>All-Starr Band</strong>, a rotating group of famous musicians with whom he continues to tour.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Ringo is also known for his acting, appearing in films such as <em>A Hard Day’s Night</em>, <em>Help!</em>, and later works outside The Beatles. He has remained a beloved figure in music for his upbeat personality and contributions to rock music, and he was inducted into the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame both as a member of The Beatles and as a solo artist.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
