		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Paul McCartney]]></title>
			<link>//paul-mccartney/</link>
			<pubDate>Wed, 02 Oct 2024 12:08:35 +0000</pubDate>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">/?p=4</guid>
			<description></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:group {"layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group"><!-- wp:block-development-examples/interactivity-router-2f43f8 {"next":"john-lennon"} -->
<div class="wp-block-block-development-examples-interactivity-router-2f43f8"><!-- wp:columns {"isStackedOnMobile":false} -->
<div class="wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile"><!-- wp:column -->
<div class="wp-block-column"><!-- wp:image {"id":30,"sizeSlug":"large","linkDestination":"none"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/WordPress/block-development-examples/trunk/plugins/interactivity-router-2f43f8/_playground/images/paul-mccartney.webp" alt="" class="wp-image-30"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->

<!-- wp:column -->
<div class="wp-block-column"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><strong>Paul McCartney</strong> is a British musician, singer, and songwriter who gained global fame as a member of <strong>The Beatles</strong>, one of the most influential bands in music history. As the bassist and co-lead vocalist, McCartney was known for his melodic bass lines and wide-ranging vocal ability. He co-wrote many iconic songs with John Lennon, contributing to hits like "Hey Jude," "Let It Be," and "Yesterday."</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:column --></div>
<!-- /wp:columns --></div>
<!-- /wp:block-development-examples/interactivity-router-2f43f8 --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>After The Beatles disbanded in 1970, McCartney continued to thrive with a successful solo career and formed the band <strong>Wings</strong>, producing hits such as "Band on the Run" and "Live and Let Die." He remains active in the music industry, celebrated for his contributions to rock and pop music.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
