			<title><![CDATA[John Lennon]]></title>
			<link>//john-lennon/</link>
			<pubDate>Wed, 02 Oct 2024 12:08:35 +0000</pubDate>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">/?p=5</guid>
			<description></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:group {"layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group"><!-- wp:block-development-examples/interactivity-router-2f43f8 {"next":"george-harrison", "prev":"paul-mccartney"} -->
<div class="wp-block-block-development-examples-interactivity-router-2f43f8"><!-- wp:columns -->
<div class="wp-block-columns"><!-- wp:column -->
<div class="wp-block-column"><!-- wp:image {"id":42,"sizeSlug":"large","linkDestination":"none"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/WordPress/block-development-examples/trunk/plugins/interactivity-router-2f43f8/_playground/images/john-lennon.webp" alt="" class="wp-image-42"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->

<!-- wp:column -->
<div class="wp-block-column"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><strong>John Lennon</strong> was a British musician, songwriter, and peace activist, best known as a founding member of <strong>The Beatles</strong>. As the band's co-lead vocalist and rhythm guitarist, Lennon contributed to some of the most famous songs in popular music, such as "Imagine," "Come Together," and "A Day in the Life." Alongside Paul McCartney, he co-wrote many of the band's biggest hits.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:column --></div>
<!-- /wp:columns --></div>
<!-- /wp:block-development-examples/interactivity-router-2f43f8 -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Lennon also had a successful solo career, particularly with his iconic peace anthem "Imagine." Throughout his life, he was an outspoken advocate for peace, often using his platform to promote anti-war and social justice causes. He was tragically assassinated in 1980, but his music and message of peace continue to inspire generations.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
